Package: maizeShootDataProcess
Type: Project
Title: Maize Shoot Spatial Transcriptomics Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reproducible R, Python, and shell workflows for processing,
    integrating, and analyzing spatial transcriptomes from developing maize
    shoots. This DESCRIPTION file declares the R dependencies used to create
    the project renv lockfile; the repository is not distributed as an R
    package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
